+          <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
+        </button>
+        <div class="details" id="faq-answer-2" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-2" hidden>
+          <p>
+            Kneading is usually a comfort behavior that starts in kittenhood. Cats often do it when they feel safe, relaxed, and content, especially in warm or familiar spots.
