+            Common signs include hiding, overgrooming, reduced appetite, changes in litter box habits, or sudden irritability. A stable routine and gradual introductions to change can help reduce stress.
+          </p>
+        </div>
+      </div>
+
+      <div class="example">
+        <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-5" id="faq-question-5">
