+          </p>
+        </div>
+      </div>
+
+      <div class="example">
+        <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-6" id="faq-question-6">
+          <span class="question-copy">What is the best way to introduce a new cat at home?</span>
+          <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
+        </button>
+        <div class="details" id="faq-answer-6" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-6" hidden>
+          <p>
+            Start slowly with separate spaces, shared scent swapping, and short supervised interactions. Gradual introductions usually lead to better long-term relationships than forcing quick contact.
+          </p>
+        </div>
+      </div>
+    </section>
+  </main>
+
